### ========================================================================
### TENANT MANAGEMENT API TESTS
### ========================================================================
### Test the school registration and validation system

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### ========================================================================
### PUBLIC ENDPOINTS (No Auth Required)
### ========================================================================

### 1. Register a New School
# @name registerSchool
POST {{baseUrl}}/tenants/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "École Primaire de Goma",
  "phone": "+243998765432",
  "email": "contact@ecolegoma.cd",
  "commune": "Goma",
  "type": "private"
}

### 2. Verify Phone with SMS Code
# Copy the code from console logs (dev mode)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tenants/verify-phone
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "+243998765432",
  "code": "473373"
}

### 3. Check School Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/tenants/check-status/+243998765432

### ========================================================================
### ADMIN ENDPOINTS (Auth Required - TODO)
### ========================================================================

### 4. Get All Pending Schools (Awaiting Validation)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/tenants/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 5. Get All Active Schools
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/tenants/active
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 6. Validate (Approve) a School
# Replace {tenantId} with actual ID from pending list
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/tenants/cmj2dcslb0000unvgtle8z3dy/validate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "validatedBy": "Admin Obed"
}

### 7. Reject a School
# Replace {dtenantId} with actual ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/tenants/cmj2dcslb0000unvgtle8z3dy/reject
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "reason": "Informations incomplètes ou incorrectes",
  "validatedBy": "Admin Obed"
}

### ========================================================================
### ERROR HANDLING TESTS
### ========================================================================

### Test: Register with Duplicate Phone
POST {{baseUrl}}/tenants/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "École Test Duplicate",
  "phone": "+243998765432",
  "email": "test@example.cd",
  "commune": "Karisimbi",
  "type": "public"
}

### Test: Invalid Phone Format
POST {{baseUrl}}/tenants/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "École Test Invalid",
  "phone": "0998765432",
  "email": "test@example.cd"
}

### Test: Wrong Verification Code
POST {{baseUrl}}/tenants/verify-phone
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "+243998765432",
  "code": "000000"
}

### Test: Check Non-Existent School
GET {{baseUrl}}/tenants/check-status/+243999999999

### ========================================================================
### FLOW TESTING SCENARIO
### ========================================================================
### Complete flow from registration to validation:
###
### 1. POST /tenants/register
###    → School created with status="pending"
###    → SMS sent with 6-digit code
###    → Check console for code (dev mode)
###
### 2. POST /tenants/verify-phone
###    → Phone verified (isPhoneVerified=true)
###    → Status still "pending"
###
### 3. GET /tenants/check-status/:phone
###    → Verify status is "pending"
###
### 4. GET /admin/tenants/pending (Admin)
###    → See school in pending list
###
### 5. POST /admin/tenants/:id/validate (Admin)
###    → Status changes to "active"
###    → Welcome SMS sent
###
### 6. GET /tenants/check-status/:phone
###    → Verify status is now "active"
###    → School can now create users
### ========================================================================


GET http://localhost:3000/admin/tenants/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}